    "chunk_text": "yt on heofenum swa swa on frym\u00f0e w\u00e6ron, \u00fea \u00f0a hi God gesceop. Ealle m\u00e6st hi sind f\u00e6ste on \u00f0am firmamentum, & \u00f0anon ne afealla\u00f0 \u00f0a hwile \u00fee \u00f0eos woruld stent. Seo sunne & se mona & \u00e6fensteorra & d\u00e6gsteorra & o\u00f0re \u00f0ry steorran ne sind na f\u00e6ste on \u00f0am \u00dea seofon sind gehatene Septem planete, & ic wat \u00fe\u00e6t hit wile \u00feincan swi\u00f0e ungeleaffullic Arcton hatte an tungel on nor\u00f0d\u00e6le; se h\u00e6f\u00f0 seofon steorran, & is for\u00f0i o\u00f0rum naman gehaten Ac he went abutan hwilon up hwilon adune, ofer d\u00e6g & ofer niht. O\u00f0er tungel is on su\u00f0d\u00e6le \u00feisum gelic, \u00f0one we ne magon n\u00e6fre geseon. Twegen steorran standa\u00f0 eac stille, an on su\u00f0d\u00e6le, o\u00feer on nor\u00f0d\u00e6le, \u00f0a sind on leden Axis gehatene; Hi sind gehatene axis, \u00fe\u00e6t is ex, for\u00f0an \u00f0e se firmamentum went on \u00f0am twam steorrum, swa swa Pliade sind gehatene \u00f0a seofon steorran \u00fee on h\u00e6rfeste upaga\u00f0, & ofer ealne winter scina\u00f0, gangende Ofer ealne sumor hi ga\u00f0 on nihtlicere tide under \u00feyssere eor\u00f0an & on d\u00e6g bufon. On winterlicere tide hi beo\u00f0 on niht uppe & on d\u00e6g adune. Comete sind gehatene \u00fea steorran \u00f0e f\u00e6rlice & ungewunelice \u00e6teowia\u00f0, & sind geleomode swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00deeah \u00f0e we swi\u00f0or sprecon be heofenlicum tunglum, ne m\u00e6g",
